{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t美軍中央司令部表示，美軍戰機星期四在阿曼灣打擊一艘試圖突破美國海軍封鎖的散裝貨船，令船隻失去航行能力。<br/>\n<br/>\n消息指，這艘貨船懸掛帕勞國旗，在離開伊朗阿巴斯港後，不顧警告試圖突破美軍封鎖，一架美軍戰機隨後發射精確制導炸彈，擊中船尾，令船隻推進系統癱瘓，船員未有受傷。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：許敬軒\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T22:04:17.188203+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T21:48:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T04:57:28.225216+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T21:57:45.626593+00:00","content_hash":"54ec0650fa2605cb3e40cd62eea4855ba2053aa2995663f7cb3f4b5a4c352206","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}